 of the island, like The Slufter. Along the wadden-coast in the east there are comparably smaller Wetlands. In the dunes, valleys like The Muy are quite popular with tourists.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Texel","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Texel","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Texel keeps its beach crowds at De Koog, a village of a thousand on the coast of the Netherlands. Dunes of Texel National Park begins at the edge of the village and Eierland Lighthouse stands further up; three hours, June to August.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":1025,"visit_h":3.3}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-dunes-of-texel-national-park","name":"Dunes of Texel National Park","kind":"Nature reserve","lat":53.08287,"lon":4.74994,"dist_km":1.8,"sig":2.483,"rank_score":8.42,"resolved_by":"catalogue","fact":"National park in the Netherlands","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/DeHors-Texel-SjoerdMartens.jpg/960px-DeHors-Texel-SjoerdMartens.jpg","author":"Kaasverhuur","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DeHors-Texel-SjoerdMartens.jpg","w":3264,"h":2448,"ok_print":true},"wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duinen_van_Texel_National_Park"},{"id":"hl-eierland-lighthouse","name":"Eierland Lighthouse","kind":"Lighthouse","lat":53.18194,"lon":4.85528,"dist_km":11.3,"rank_score":7.87,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Eierland_Lighthouse_texel.jpg/960px-Eierland_Lighthouse_texel.jpg","author":"Yornik Heyl","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eierland_Lighthouse_texel.jpg","w":2289,"h":3434,"ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-noorderhaaks","name":"Noorderhaaks","kind":"Island","lat":52.975,"lon":4.68056,"dist_km":14.6,"rank_score":7.52,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image